The constraints force three blocks: Ben–Elif–Gus in three consecutive slots, Dev–Ann in two consecutive slots, and Ivo with exactly one slot then Cara. Elif is before Dev, so Ben–Elif–Gus sits entirely before Dev–Ann, and Ivo is after Ann. The only placement that also leaves a legal slot for Finn before Dev and keeps every “at least three slots apart” pair at distance ≥ 3 is:

SCHEDULE: {"1":"Finn","2":"Ben","3":"Elif","4":"Gus","5":"Dev","6":"Ann","7":"Ivo","8":"Hana","9":"Cara"}
CONFIDENCE: 100
